OL,3,ATwo dead after car hits group of
OL,4,Apedestrians
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have died and four people
OL,7,Fhave been seriously injured after a car
OL,8,Fcrashed into a group of people in
OL,9,FDoncaster.
OL,11,FSouth Yorkshire Police said officers
OL,12,Fwere called to White Rose Way when a
OL,13,Fblack Mitsubishi L200 hit a group of
OL,14,Fpedestrians at 11:00 BST on Sunday,
OL,15,Fbefore hitting a black Audi and silver
OL,16,FBMW on the opposite carriageway.
OL,18,FThe force said two of the pedestrians
OL,19,Fhad died at the scene while four other
OL,20,Fpeople were taken to hospital with
OL,21,Fserious injuries.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
