OL,3,ATwo dead after car hits group of
OL,4,Apedestrians
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the Mitsubishi, a
OL,7,F30-year-old man, was arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of two counts of causing
OL,9,Fdeath by dangerous driving, two counts
OL,10,Fof causing serious injury by dangerous
OL,11,Fdriving and driving while unfit and
OL,12,Flater released on bail.
